# Normalize all text to LF in the repo and in the working tree on every OS.
# Without this, a Windows checkout CRLF-converts files, which (a) breaks any
# byte-exact fixture (e.g. the resource-intelligence verified SHA-256) and
# (b) can corrupt script parsing. LF everywhere keeps the baseline identical
# on Windows, macOS, Linux, and CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
